msgid "Installing an input method requires an Internet connection."
msgstr "Memasang metode masukan memerlukan koneksi Internet."

msgid ""
"No Internet connection. Input methods cannot be installed. You can install "
"them later when connected."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada koneksi Internet. Metode masukan tidak dapat dipasang. Anda dapat "
"memasangnya nanti saat terhubung."

msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"A real installation will create a machine-local MOK. After reboot, choose Enroll MOK → Continue → Yes in MOKManager and enter password 123456."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Pemasangan asli akan membuat MOK lokal mesin. Setelah reboot, pilih Enroll MOK → Lanjutkan → Ya di MOKManager dan masukkan kata sandi 123456."

msgid ""
"\n"
"On the blue MOKManager screen choose Enroll MOK → Continue → Yes, password: 123456"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Pada layar biru MOKManager, pilih Enroll MOK → Lanjutkan → Ya, kata sandi: 123456"

msgid "4 GiB disk swap (priority 10) + 50% RAM LZ4 zram (priority 100)"
msgstr "Swap disk 4 GiB (prioritas 10) + zram LZ4 RAM 50% (prioritas 100)"

msgid "; sudo does not require a password"
msgstr "; sudo tidak memerlukan kata sandi"

msgid "; sudo requires the account password"
msgstr "; sudo memerlukan kata sandi akun"

msgid ""
"A partition on this disk is mounted. Unmount it and rescan storage before "
"continuing."
msgstr ""
"Sebuah partisi pada disk ini sedang dipasang (mounted). Lepaskan pemasangan "
"dan pindai ulang penyimpanan sebelum melanjutkan."

msgid "ALL DATA on {disk} will be permanently erased."
msgstr "SEMUA DATA pada {disk} akan dihapus secara permanen."

msgid "Account security"
msgstr "Keamanan akun"

msgid "Advanced Storage"
msgstr "Penyimpanan Lanjutan"

msgid ""
"Advanced coexistence can affect EFI firmware state and may trigger BitLocker"
" recovery. It never shrinks or repairs Windows volumes."
msgstr ""
"Koeksistensi lanjutan dapat mempengaruhi status firmware EFI dan mungkin "
"memicu pemulihan BitLocker. Fitur ini tidak pernah mengecilkan atau "
"memperbaiki volume Windows."

msgid "Advanced — keep existing systems"
msgstr "Lanjutan — pertahankan sistem yang ada"

msgid "Advanced: Install Alongside"
msgstr "Lanjutan: Instal Bersamaan"

msgid ""
"After changing partitions or unmounting a volume, rescan storage and select "
"the target again."
msgstr ""
"Setelah mengubah partisi atau melepaskan pemasangan volume, pindai ulang "
"penyimpanan dan pilih target lagi."

msgid ""
"After restart, MOKManager will open. Choose Enroll MOK → Continue → Yes, "
"then enter password 123456."
msgstr ""
"Setelah restart, MOKManager akan terbuka. Pilih Enroll MOK → Lanjutkan → Ya,"
" lalu masukkan kata sandi 123456."

msgid ""
"All partitions and data on {disk} will be destroyed.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Semua partisi dan data pada {disk} akan hancur.\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, you may explicitly select one entire partition to erase. "
"Everything in that selected partition will be destroyed; it is never "
"selected automatically."
msgstr ""
"Sebagai alternatif, Anda dapat secara eksplisit memilih satu partisi utuh "
"untuk dihapus. Semua isi pada partisi yang dipilih akan dihancurkan; partisi"
" ini tidak pernah dipilih secara otomatis."

msgid "Battery power is too low for a safe installation."
msgstr "Daya baterai terlalu rendah untuk instalasi yang aman."

msgid "Charge to at least 80% before starting the installation."
msgstr "Isi daya hingga setidaknya 80% sebelum memulai instalasi."

msgid "Continue Anyway"
msgstr "Tetap Lanjutkan"

msgid "Current battery level: {percent}%"
msgstr "Tingkat baterai saat ini: {percent}%"

msgid "External power is connected."
msgstr "Daya eksternal tersambung."

msgid "External power is not connected."
msgstr "Daya eksternal tidak tersambung."

msgid "I understand the risks and insist on installing with low battery."
msgstr ""
"Saya memahami risikonya dan tetap ingin menginstal dengan daya baterai "
"rendah."

msgid "Low battery"
msgstr "Baterai lemah"

msgid "Recheck"
msgstr "Periksa ulang"

msgid "AnduinOS Installer"
msgstr "Penginstal AnduinOS"

msgid "AnduinOS Installer (Beta)"
msgstr "Penginstal AnduinOS (Beta)"

msgid "AnduinOS Installer (Development)"
msgstr "Penginstal AnduinOS (Pengembangan)"

msgid ""
"AnduinOS will use only the selected unallocated space on {disk}. Existing partitions will be preserved.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"AnduinOS hanya akan menggunakan ruang yang belum dialokasikan yang dipilih pada {disk}. Partisi yang ada akan dipertahankan.\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"AnduinOS will use only the selected unallocated space. The installer will "
"not shrink or move an existing filesystem."
msgstr ""
"AnduinOS hanya akan menggunakan ruang yang belum dialokasikan yang dipilih. "
"Pemasang tidak akan mengecilkan atau memindahkan sistem berkas yang ada."

msgid "Arabic"
msgstr "Arab"

msgid "Back"
msgstr "Kembali"

msgid ""
"Before continuing: finish Windows updates, disable Fast Startup and "
"hibernation, and back up the BitLocker recovery key. EFI, Secure Boot, TPM "
"measurements and boot order can change."
msgstr ""
"Sebelum melanjutkan: selesaikan pembaruan Windows, nonaktifkan Startup Cepat"
" dan hibernasi, serta cadangkan kunci pemulihan BitLocker. EFI, Secure Boot,"
" pengukuran TPM, dan urutan boot dapat berubah."

msgid "BitLocker detected"
msgstr "BitLocker terdeteksi"

msgid ""
"BitLocker storage will be preserved. The installer will not unlock, resize, "
"repair or otherwise modify it."
msgstr ""
"Penyimpanan BitLocker akan dipertahankan. Pemasang tidak akan membuka kunci,"
" mengubah ukuran, memperbaiki, atau memodifikasinya dengan cara lain."

msgid "Boot policy"
msgstr "Kebijakan boot"

msgid "Btrfs (recommended)"
msgstr "Btrfs (direkomendasikan)"

msgid "Btrfs — recommended"
msgstr "Btrfs — direkomendasikan"

msgid "Cannot create installation plan"
msgstr "Tidak dapat membuat rencana instalasi"

msgid "Choose Installation Method"
msgstr "Pilih Metode Instalasi"

msgid "Choose one target disk. Storage settings come next."
msgstr "Pilih satu disk target. Pengaturan penyimpanan akan menyusul."

msgid "Choose optional software to install"
msgstr "Pilih perangkat lunak opsional untuk diinstal"

msgid "Choose your language to begin installation"
msgstr "Pilih bahasa Anda untuk memulai instalasi"

msgid "Choose your location to set the system clock"
msgstr "Pilih lokasi Anda untuk mengatur jam sistem"

msgid "Complete"
msgstr "Selesai"

msgid "Computer Name"
msgstr "Nama Komputer"

msgid "Computer name contains invalid characters."
msgstr "Nama komputer berisi karakter tidak valid."

msgid "Configure account, region, timezone, and machine identity"
msgstr "Konfigurasi akun, wilayah, zona waktu, dan identitas mesin"

msgid "Configure storage and swap"
msgstr "Konfigurasi penyimpanan dan swap"

msgid "Confirm Password"
msgstr "Konfirmasi Kata Sandi"

msgid "Confirm your keyboard layout"
msgstr "Konfirmasi tata letak keyboard Anda"

msgid "Continue Installation"
msgstr "Lanjutkan Instalasi"

msgid "Copy AnduinOS system"
msgstr "Salin sistem AnduinOS"

msgid "Copy Log"
msgstr "Salin Log"

msgid "Create a new 1 GiB AnduinOS EFI System Partition"
msgstr "Buat Partisi Sistem EFI AnduinOS 1 GiB baru"

msgid ""
"Create and format a dedicated AnduinOS EFI System Partition inside the "
"selected space."
msgstr ""
"Buat dan format Partisi Sistem EFI AnduinOS khusus di dalam ruang yang "
"dipilih."

msgid "Create your user account"
msgstr "Buat akun pengguna Anda"

msgid "Current disk layout"
msgstr "Tata letak disk saat ini"

msgid ""
"DEVELOPMENT MODE — the plan will be validated and simulated. No privileged "
"executor or disk command can run."
msgstr ""
"MODE PENGEMBANGAN — rencana akan divalidasi dan disimulasikan. Tidak ada "
"eksekutor hak istimewa atau perintah disk yang dapat dijalankan."

msgid "Danish"
msgstr "Denmark"

msgid "Detect Internet connectivity"
msgstr "Deteksi koneksi internet"

msgid "Detect firmware and Secure Boot"
msgstr "Deteksi firmware dan Secure Boot"

msgid ""
"Development mode will simulate installation to {disk}. No disk data will be changed.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Mode pengembangan akan mensimulasikan instalasi ke {disk}. Tidak ada data disk yang akan diubah.\n"
"\n"

msgid "Development simulation completed"
msgstr "Simulasi pengembangan selesai"

msgid "Discover AnduinOS"
msgstr "Jelajahi AnduinOS"

msgid "Download and install system updates during installation"
msgstr "Unduh dan instal pembaruan sistem selama instalasi"

